    "detailed_description": "<strong>The world of Quirk! is in danger and there's only one character who is bold enough to save the day. </strong><br><br>Meet the Mischief Monster; a carefree child of the Quirkiverse. He dips and dashes into other Quirk abilities for fun of it! Until, disaster strikes. A Jester from another land takes over. Unleashing his pranks into every corner of the world and claiming his title as Quirkiest of them all!<br><br>The Jester knows only one thing: As long as the Quirks have no abilities, he will remain in power... and Mischief will be powerless.<br><br>The Quirks are counting on you to unleash your mischief and rid the world of these blasted pranks!<br><br>Can you help Mischief find the Quirk abilities in time and take back the Quirkiverse?!",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>The world of Quirk! is in danger and there's only one character who is bold enough to save the day. </strong><br><br>Meet the Mischief Monster; a carefree child of the Quirkiverse. He dips and dashes into other Quirk abilities for fun of it! Until, disaster strikes. A Jester from another land takes over. Unleashing his pranks into every corner of the world and claiming his title as Quirkiest of them all!<br><br>The Jester knows only one thing: As long as the Quirks have no abilities, he will remain in power... and Mischief will be powerless.<br><br>The Quirks are counting on you to unleash your mischief and rid the world of these blasted pranks!<br><br>Can you help Mischief find the Quirk abilities in time and take back the Quirkiverse?!",
